<section class="rd-section" id="about">
  <div class="rd-section-head">
    <div class="rd-section-num">01</div>
    <h2 class="rd-section-kicker">About</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="rd-body">
    <p class="rd-about-lede">
      I am a <span class="rd-inline-chip">PHYSICIAN &amp; CLINICAL DATA ANALYST</span> pursuing an <a href="https://www.heinz.cmu.edu/programs/health-care-analytics-master/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rd-underline">M.S. in Health Care Analytics &amp; IT</a> at Carnegie Mellon&rsquo;s Heinz College, on a Royal Thai Government (DDC) scholarship.
    </p>

    {/* Framed as what a good record does, not as what a bad one fails at.
        The earlier draft itemised the failures of Thailand's paper
        immunisation record -- accurate, but a DDC physician on a Royal Thai
        Government scholarship publishing that is an exposure, and it read
        as blame. Same specifics, stated as the target. */}
    <p class="rd-about-body">
      A vaccination record should answer three things wherever it is opened: what was given,
      which product and lot, and when. Making that reliably true &mdash; legible anywhere,
      verifiable, available to the next clinician &mdash; is the problem I want to work on.
    </p>

    <p class="rd-about-body">
      I come at it from a travel clinic, where that record is also a document a border may ask
      for, and from outbreak investigation teams, where it sets how fast a response can move.
      A health system works when it is designed around the people using it at the point of
      care, and when its parts can talk to each other.
    </p>

    {/* Heinz is named once, in the lede. Repeating it here -- and restating
        "the problem I want to work on" from the first paragraph -- was what
        made this section read long; the word count barely moved. */}
    <p class="rd-about-body">
      So far that has meant a guardrailed surveillance assistant for the DDC and clinical
      decision support for altitude risk. What I want to build toward is a national vaccine
      registry &mdash; interoperability, governance, and frameworks that hold up.
    </p>

    <p class="rd-about-ask">Looking for a Summer 2027 internship in health care analytics.</p>

